---

## 📝 Quick Reference

### Syntax

```sql
function_name() OVER (
    PARTITION BY col   -- optional: divide into groups
    ORDER BY     col   -- optional: order within window
)
```

---

### GROUP BY vs Window Function

| | GROUP BY | Window Function |
|---|---|---|
| Rows returned | 1 per group | All rows kept |
| Individual records | Lost | Preserved |
| Added column | No | Yes |
| Use when | You want summary | You want summary + detail |

---

### Ranking Functions

| Function | Handles Ties | Output on tie | Use For |
|---|---|---|---|
| `ROW_NUMBER()` | Unique always | Different numbers | Deduplication, pagination |
| `RANK()` | Shared rank + gap | 1,2,2,4 | Leaderboards, sports |
| `DENSE_RANK()` | Shared rank, no gap | 1,2,2,3 | Grades, tiers |

---

## ⚠️ Common Mistakes

| Mistake | Fix |
|---|---|
| Using window function in WHERE | Use a subquery — window functions run after WHERE |
| Forgetting ORDER BY in ranking | RANK without ORDER BY gives all rows rank 1 |
| Confusing PARTITION BY with GROUP BY | PARTITION BY keeps all rows — GROUP BY collapses |
| Expecting no NULLs from LAG/LEAD | First/last rows always return NULL — use default arg |
